[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the motor retaining bolt.</p><p>2. Disconnect the motor electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Right air mixture flap actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024538\">N79</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Remove the motor (3a) releasing the intake (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004838.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the motor is undamaged.</p><p>Position the motor engaging the intake\nin the compulsory position.</p><p>Connect the motor electrical connections.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the motor.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p>"],[31,63,128,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, follow the safety instructions for working on the system\nvery carefully (See 5580C - Air Bag System - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025796\">7040A10</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the motor retaining bolt.</p><p>2. Disconnect the motor electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Right air mixture flap actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024538\">N79</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Remove the motor (3a) releasing the intake (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004839.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,128,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the motor is undamaged.</p><p>Position the motor engaging the intake\nin the compulsory position.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the motor.</p><p>Connect the motor electrical connections.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025796\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p>"]]